meditative, and the beginning rituals of ceremonial magick. I embraced the 
work with great energy and passion. Today, twenty-three years later, when I 
look at my magical journals of that period, I am exhausted just reading 
about my routine. 

I rose before dawn; performed the banishing rituals of the pentagram and 
hexagram. I then limbered up with yoga, eleven rounds of an eleven-fold 
solar adoration, after which I settled into my asana2 and did pranayama. I 
concluded the meditation period with exercises designed to increase my 
concentration skills, then dosed with a repeat of the banishing rituals of the 
pentagram and hexagram. 


