Everything was ready except the Holy Oil, which I would need so I could 
anoint my head and consecrate my wand, the sigils, and other temple 
furniture. For some smug reason I had convinced myself that the ceremony 
would be doomed to failure if I used anything other than pure Oil of 
Abramelin. 


